          "short": "$\\dfrac{12}{rs^2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3r^2s^3\\times4r^{-3}s^{-5}&=12r^{2-3}s^{3-5}\\\\3r^2s^3\\times4r^{-3}s^{-5}&=12r^{-1}s^{-2}\\\\3r^2s^3\\times4r^{-3}s^{-5}&=\\frac{12}{rs^2}\\end{align*}$$",
